{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000025411","bookName":"Tócame, mi esposa","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000025411/42000025411.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":376967,"followCount":10725,"introduction":"Camilo Holgado, quien sufre de ginofobia, se reencuentra con la Dra. Katia Colina, su exesposa, durante una terapia. Sin reconocerla, cree que es solo una “aventura de una noche”, mientras que Katia trata de ocultar su verdadera identidad, convencida de que lo “engañó”. A medida que Camilo enfrenta su miedo a las mujeres, su relación oscila entre la cercanía y la distancia. ¿Descubrirá que la mujer de la que se está enamorando es en realidad su exesposa? ¿Qué pasará después?","chapterCount":59,"labels":["Second Chance","Doctor"],"tags":["Second Chance","Doctor"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Tócame-mi-esposa","bookNameLower":"tócame-mi-esposa","shelfTime":"2026-08-22 00:00:01","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-22 00:00:01","performerList":[{"performerId":"12194","performerName":"Ryan Ray Vincent","performerFormatName":"Ryan-Ray-Vincent","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x9/12194/12194.jpg?time=1787724401314","videoCount":5},{"performerId":"12073","performerName":"Greta Donnelly","performerFormatName":"Greta-Donnelly","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/3x7/12073/12073.jpg?time=1787305806999","videoCount":1},{"performerId":"12213","performerName":"Shane Dorriz","performerFormatName":"Shane-Dorriz","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/3x1/12213/12213.jpg?time=1787305806886","videoCount":5}],"performerIdList":[12073,12194,12213]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701512846","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/64/1x1/11x4/114x5/11452000024/701512846_1/7015128